; A pad is sized from the balance at the assertion it serves, with the padding of
; every assertion served before it. The pad of the sub-account is dated first but
; serves a later assertion: the parent is padded without it, and its assertion,
; which the sub-account's padding then changes, fails, as in beancount.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:Bank
1970-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open

2024-01-01 pad Assets:Bank:Checking Equity:Open
2024-01-02 pad Assets:Bank Equity:Open
2024-01-03 balance Assets:Bank  100 CNY
2024-01-04 balance Assets:Bank:Checking  60 CNY
